.TH CAMERA_TO_SCREEN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_to_screen \- Convert a world position to screen pixels for drawing: (world \- pos \- offset) * zoom + half the view
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 camera_to_screen(const Camera *c, Vec2 world);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert a world position to screen pixels for drawing: (world \- pos \- offset) * zoom + half the view. Use for every entity: Vec2 s = camera_to_screen(&cam, ent.pos); sprite_draw(&spr, f, s.x, s.y, 0, FLIP_NONE).
.SH RETURN VALUE
the position in logical pixels.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_to_world (3),
.BR camera_rect (3),
.BR sprite_draw (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
